    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/4f5da8bf8ff9bd538abd1f2b10dfaee3.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/3ac0027966fdb8500ef1926b54d2e108.webp?t=1752296824\" width=148 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a day in September 2024, student Ji Wang welcomes his new deskmate: TONO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TONO's arrival brings vibrant colors to Ji Wang's monotonous life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 100-Day Oath Ceremony, study tours, English Festival, graduation... The college entrance exam approaches silently amidst daily routines. Before he knows it, Ji Wang finds himself holding his exam admission ticket at the gates of the testing center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/50081127444b64d3bc8a0008e16a8e9e.avif?t=1752296824\" width=184 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/e1288fcd015ab4b15d24bf5a0a0a197f.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ji Wang's new deskmate, initially perceived as a &quot;humanities genius.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually struggles with rote memorization but surprisingly loves joking around. Enjoys collecting pink accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/ffda40f6231c2f3ffd5e8029f042090b.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The class-recognized academic ace. Excels in humanities and math, yet seemingly weak in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves anime, 2D mobile games, and RTS games. Rumored to be an avid Six Kingdoms player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIPERA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/4651b50cd53f85533462155d03711156.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attends Mi'sa City First Iron High School. Reportedly already admitted to a prestigious university, often seen standing at the observatory gate near Mi'sa Experimental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggles with humanities but eagerly learns new things. Prefers physical books over e-books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/784bd0a435af234d6d15cefd189b82f6.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=443 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every character features rich branch stories</strong> to explore throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/d173de8c35dce253910d4d2b440149f6.avif?t=1752296824\" width=209 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap to advance the storyline!</strong> Whether chatting, solving problems, or browsing videos, every choice may unlock bonus scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/81a65a7e4a7f50dbc2411fd0cc565cbd.avif?t=1752296824\" width=149 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liangpi! Roujiamo! And Mi'sa's iconic &quot;Icce Peek&quot; sparkling drink\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a Mi'sa City journey that begins in one summer and ends in another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/3afa0fafdbaa882789d5a762483ad656.avif?t=1752296824\" width=114 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear Visitor, welcome to Mi'sa City.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ImaginaryObservatory is dedicated to creating Chinese romance visual novels (Galgame), aiming to deliver a fresh experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/4f5da8bf8ff9bd538abd1f2b10dfaee3.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/3ac0027966fdb8500ef1926b54d2e108.webp?t=1752296824\" width=148 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a day in September 2024, student Ji Wang welcomes his new deskmate: TONO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TONO's arrival brings vibrant colors to Ji Wang's monotonous life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 100-Day Oath Ceremony, study tours, English Festival, graduation... The college entrance exam approaches silently amidst daily routines. Before he knows it, Ji Wang finds himself holding his exam admission ticket at the gates of the testing center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/50081127444b64d3bc8a0008e16a8e9e.avif?t=1752296824\" width=184 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/e1288fcd015ab4b15d24bf5a0a0a197f.avif?t=1752296824\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ji Wang's new deskmate, initially perceived as a &quot;humanities genius.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually struggles with rote memorization but surprisingly loves joking around. Enjoys collecting pink accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\